{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zwhN7gb3t61795344819.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>選委會界別分組選舉投票結束後，點票工作展開。</p><p></p><p>投票傍晚六時結束後，票箱約六時半起，陸續運抵灣仔會展的中央點票站。政制及內地事務局局長謝小華、選管會主席陸啟康等將選票倒出。</p><p></p><p>之後展開點票工作，各界別的選舉結果，稍後會在會展的中央點票站公布。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:43:53.124484+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:57:13.881190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:37:16.372439+00:00","content_hash":"eb64562f56257b8f2220826cbaa3cf9ca07317e53f149d82d9726f0d46d70aed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:43:53.124484+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}